**Please read these Procedures carefully.**

**1 BEFORE SELLING OR BUYING A RESALE FLAT**

1.1 Sellers, please check whether:

(a) you have met the Minimum Occupation PeriodPeriod (MOP). You can login to MyHDB Page with your Singpass and check if you have met the MOP to sell your flat - under My Flat > Purchased Flat > Flat Details > Minimum Occupation Period (MOP).

